{"w":2400,"lines":[{"y":0.097383720669228291,"t":"DIANA:","x":0.1028806588967008,"h":0.010174418787512463,"c":1,"w":0.045267489751180015},{"h":0.008720930389296444,"y":0.11337209289643702,"x":0.102880658119194,"t":"TIM:","w":0.028806584676106778,"c":1},{"t":"DIANA:","y":0.12645348815348212,"h":0.010174418787512463,"w":0.045267489751180001,"c":1,"x":0.10288065872523303},{"t":"TIM:","w":0.028806584676106764,"x":0.10288065816843601,"c":1,"h":0.0072674419910804255,"y":0.14244186037185691},{"t":"DIANA:","w":0.045267489751180001,"x":0.10288065866350465,"y":0.18459302306263914,"c":1,"h":0.010174418787512463},{"t":"TIM:","w":0.03086419741312664,"h":0.010174418787512574,"x":0.10082304522347783,"c":1,"y":0.22819767429325921},{"x":0.10082304579808112,"c":1,"t":"DIANA:","h":0.011627907185728592,"y":0.27034883695946132,"w":0.047325102488199863},{"x":0.10288065817634992,"w":0.028806584676106778,"c":1,"t":"TIM:","y":0.28633720919281025,"h":0.008720930389296444},{"h":0.013081394460653373,"w":0.047325102488199863,"t":"DIANA:","x":0.10082304579808112,"y":0.29796511655964419,"c":1},{"y":0.38662790686203774,"x":0.10288065815920315,"c":1,"h":0.0087209303892965551,"w":0.028806584676106764,"t":"TIM:"},{"x":0.10288065853510101,"h":0.010174418787512463,"c":1,"w":0.043209877014160153,"t":"DIANA:","y":0.45784883699069145},{"t":"DIANA:","h":0.0092127775275383517,"c":1,"x":0.10278377909196475,"w":0.043403635025024409,"y":0.49248663447245711},{"t":"TIM:","y":0.5218023254718801,"h":0.008720930389296444,"x":0.10288065817634992,"c":1,"w":0.028806584676106778},{"t":"DIANA:","x":0.10288065872523303,"y":0.53488372102367454,"c":1,"w":0.045267489751180001,"h":0.0087209298276508251},{"c":1,"w":0.030864197413126626,"t":"TIM:","x":0.1008230453880869,"h":0.010174418787512463,"y":0.56395348817891822},{"t":"DIANA:","c":1,"y":0.5915697672232495,"x":0.10288065872523303,"h":0.010174418787512574,"w":0.045267489751180001},{"x":0.10288065815920315,"y":0.60755813942017733,"t":"TIM:","h":0.008720930389296444,"c":1,"w":0.028806584676106764},{"t":"DIANA:","y":0.64970930210481015,"w":0.047325102488199877,"h":0.011627907185728703,"c":1,"x":0.10082304569005643},{"t":"TIM:","x":0.10082304522347783,"y":0.72238372080488722,"w":0.03086419741312664,"h":0.010174418787512574,"c":1},{"h":0.010174418787512574,"c":1,"x":0.10288065872523303,"t":"DIANA:","w":0.045267489751180001,"y":0.7790697672232495},{"w":0.028806584676106764,"h":0.008720930389296444,"x":0.10288065816843601,"t":"TIM:","y":0.79505813942297254,"c":1},{"h":0.008720930389296444,"c":0.30000001192092896,"y":0.046511627815394085,"t":"1718867188","w":0.069958845774332645,"x":0.7716049391467531},{"h":0.011627907185728592,"w":0.31481480916341142,"x":0.19341564057638269,"t":"Oh, I heard their wool's really sought after.","y":0.097383720821646036,"c":1},{"w":0.3950617218017578,"h":0.011778563015312105,"t":"Yes. It's very hardwearing and they use it for carpets.","c":1,"x":0.19341564104996081,"y":0.11189634877293786},{"c":1,"t":"Right.","y":0.12645348823853109,"w":0.047325102488199849,"x":0.19135802477956262,"h":0.011627907185728592},{"t":"I was interested in the amount of supplements they add to animals' feed","x":0.19341564129040875,"h":0.013081395583944611,"y":0.1395348835982666,"w":0.53292180379231768,"c":1},{"h":0.011778563015312216,"c":1,"w":0.53497940063476568,"t":"nowadays. Like, even the chickens got extra vitamins and electrolytes in","x":0.1934156493800783,"y":0.15547703170822591},{"h":0.010355096823756349,"t":"their feed.","w":0.07617966334025067,"y":0.16996780041010306,"c":1,"x":0.19339164969946959},{"h":0.013081395583944611,"x":0.19341563928642511,"t":"Yes, I found that too. And they're not cheap. But my farmer said some are","y":0.18313953476272471,"w":0.54526748657226554,"c":1},{"t":"overpriced for what they are. And he didn't give them as a matter of routine, just","x":0.19341563178838772,"w":0.59465021769205728,"y":0.19758539485372051,"h":0.011778563015312105,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.19341563415041738,"t":"at times when the chickens seemed to particularly require them.","w":0.47325103759765619,"y":0.21220930258893644,"h":0.011627906062437243},{"t":"Yes, mine said the same. He said certain breeds of chickens might need more","x":0.19341564277236159,"y":0.22673733778101235,"w":0.57818929036458333,"c":1,"h":0.01308824372937456},{"y":0.24116607778828802,"w":0.59465021769205739,"c":1,"x":0.1934156318119698,"h":0.011778563015312105,"t":"supplements than the others, but the cheap and expensive ones are all basically"},{"y":0.25627115909939269,"w":0.076806971232096344,"h":0.010546032756180823,"t":"the same.","x":0.19308255299593025,"c":1},{"y":0.26939647493726748,"w":0.039605509440104159,"t":"Mm.","h":0.01463527814238319,"c":1,"x":0.1901802164621941},{"h":0.0143851986762632,"t":"So did your farm have any other livestock, Diana?","w":0.37053311665852862,"y":0.28338875289205323,"c":1,"x":0.1933450946460592},{"c":1,"h":0.013081395583944611,"w":0.57201644897460935,"x":0.19341564372105893,"y":0.29796511615911148,"t":"Yes, dairy cows. I made a really embarrassing mistake when I was working in"},{"t":"the milk shed. Some cows had been treated with antibiotics, so their milk wasn't","x":0.19341564906732941,"c":1,"w":0.59259256998697918,"h":0.013250883392226021,"y":0.31242638386115096},{"w":0.60082305908203126,"x":0.19341563085847033,"y":0.32703488360079125,"t":"suitable for human consumption, and it had to be put in a separate container. But","h":0.013081395583944611,"c":1},{"h":0.011627907185728592,"w":0.58230453491210943,"c":1,"t":"Igot mixed up, and I poured some milk from the wrong cow in with the milk for","x":0.1913580205194442,"y":0.34156976733492539},{"w":0.57818929036458333,"h":0.011778563015312105,"c":1,"x":0.19341564279288548,"y":0.356007067370262,"t":"humans, so the whole lot had to be thrown away. The farmer wasn't too happy"},{"w":0.066466083526611319,"x":0.19110150281452098,"h":0.012504600102544838,"c":1,"t":"with me.","y":0.37064990157325761},{"x":0.19341564937357797,"w":0.53497940063476568,"t":"I asked my farmer how much he depended on the vet to deal with health","y":0.38515901087275406,"h":0.011778563015312105,"c":1},{"t":"problems. I'd read reports that the livestock's health is being affected as farmers","y":0.39958775030520921,"w":0.59259256998697918,"c":1,"h":0.011778563015312216,"x":0.19341564905549974},{"t":"are under pressure to increase production. Well, he didn't agree with that, but","x":0.19341562666162598,"w":0.57407409667968756,"y":0.41279069754752107,"h":0.013081395583944611,"c":1},{"t":"he said that actually some of the stuff the vets do, like minor operations, he'd be","h":0.01485165493788787,"c":1,"y":0.42610414843266842,"w":0.59066813151041664,"x":0.19334651334701922},{"h":0.013086531271782942,"c":1,"x":0.19135802798610474,"t":"quite capable of doing himself.","y":0.44186046498661291,"w":0.22839505513509117},{"h":0.014534883982160851,"t":"Yeah. My farmer said the same. But he reckons vets' skills are still needed.","x":0.1913580264967327,"w":0.5576131693522135,"c":1,"y":0.45494186018915217},{"w":0.57215230305989584,"x":0.19335263907385969,"y":0.48921754232004666,"c":1,"t":"Now we've got to give a bit of feedback about last term's modules - just short","h":0.014201033943814223},{"h":0.013081395583944722,"c":1,"t":"comments, apparently. Shall we do that now?","x":0.19341564144808993,"y":0.50436046499153775,"w":0.33744855244954425},{"t":"OK. So medical terminology.","w":0.21427571614583335,"y":0.51913264337801912,"c":1,"x":0.19328167812462832,"h":0.013017696542369173},{"y":0.53343023232370368,"t":"Well, my heart sank when I saw that, especially right at the beginning of the","x":0.19135803389267514,"w":0.5596707661946615,"h":0.014567411690072807,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"course. And I did struggle with it.","x":0.19341563920161814,"y":0.54941860454006386,"h":0.011627907185728592,"w":0.24074073791503903},{"c":1,"x":0.19135802270342159,"t":"I'd thought it'd be hard, but actually I found it all quite straightforward.","y":0.56242638386094168,"h":0.013250883392226132,"w":0.51234568277994785},{"y":0.57570593392646896,"h":0.013441106034673189,"c":1,"x":0.1933176277458486,"t":"What did you think about diet and nutrition?","w":0.32323104858398433},{"y":0.59156976730506849,"w":0.11316872914632159,"c":1,"x":0.1934156351239128,"h":0.011627907185728703,"t":"OK, I suppose."},{"w":0.59465021769205728,"h":0.011778563015312105,"x":0.19341563179183141,"c":1,"y":0.60600706737089094,"t":"Do you remember what they told us about pet food and the fact that there's such"},{"y":0.6191860467749829,"c":1,"t":"limited checking into whether or not it's contaminated? I mean in comparison with","w":0.60082300821940104,"h":0.011627906062437354,"x":0.19341565947054637},{"y":0.63373483826094212,"t":"the checks on food for humans - I thought that was terrible.","x":0.19335683777932214,"w":0.44251388549804693,"c":1,"h":0.013102060774049407},{"t":"Mm. I think the module that really impressed me was the animal disease one,","y":0.64626311602813635,"w":0.57842061360677088,"h":0.018035859466301041,"c":1,"x":0.19125098126718759},{"x":0.19341562944727769,"w":0.55555557250976562,"c":1,"t":"when we looked at domesticated animals in different parts of the world, like","h":0.013081395583944722,"y":0.6627906975500516},{"t":"camels and water buffalo and alpaca. The economies of so many countries","w":0.55555557250976562,"y":0.67726737345423882,"h":0.011778563015312105,"c":1,"x":0.19341562928576725},{"t":"depend on these, but scientists don't know much about the diseases that affect","y":0.69186046486791131,"w":0.59053497314453129,"x":0.19135803299563559,"h":0.013086531833428561,"c":1},{"x":0.19135802448312053,"y":0.70784883705636059,"w":0.045267489751180029,"h":0.011627907185728592,"c":1,"t":"them."},{"y":0.7208480563646209,"w":0.59259256998697918,"h":0.014723203769140158,"t":"Yes, I thought they'd know a lot about ways of controlling and eradicating those","c":1,"x":0.19135803588483025},{"y":0.73546511616789489,"w":0.28395062764485679,"x":0.19341563252116942,"h":0.011627907185728592,"t":"diseases, but that's not the case at all.","c":1},{"c":1,"y":0.74999999989279098,"t":"I loved the wildlife medication unit. Things like helping birds that have been","w":0.5534979248046874,"x":0.19341564654202387,"h":0.011627907185728703},{"x":0.19341563055042285,"w":0.49176956176757813,"c":1,"h":0.011778563015312105,"y":0.76442873988653759,"t":"caught in oil spills. That's something I hadn't thought about before."},{"t":"Yeah, I thought I might write my dissertation on something connected with that.","x":0.1912916073787656,"c":1,"y":0.77758481471272278,"w":0.58448796590169272,"h":0.015967327517811714},{"w":0.091056105295817064,"x":0.19309979897063187,"h":0.012888525343896062,"t":"Right. So ...","y":0.7931846823547104,"c":1},{"h":0.011627907185728592,"y":0.19767441846595923,"x":0.81893004153995586,"w":0.034979422887166378,"t":"Q24","c":1},{"c":1,"t":"Q25","y":0.34156976728583199,"x":0.81893004174975637,"w":0.037037035624186254,"h":0.013081395583944833},{"w":0.034979422887166378,"x":0.81893004154638593,"y":0.42732558123691566,"t":"Q26","h":0.013081395583944722,"c":1},{"h":0.011627907185728592,"c":1,"x":0.81893004153995586,"y":0.56249999986130805,"t":"Q27","w":0.034979422887166378},{"y":0.60465116307127209,"h":0.013081394460653484,"t":"Q28","x":0.81893004182287765,"c":1,"w":0.034979422887166378},{"w":0.034979422887166378,"h":0.013081395583944722,"t":"Q29","x":0.81893004154638593,"c":1,"y":0.67732558123691577},{"c":1,"x":0.81893004159607263,"h":0.013081395583944722,"t":"Q30","w":0.034979422887166378,"y":0.77761627889275287},{"y":0.86773255796252025,"h":0.013081395583944722,"w":0.024691357612609877,"c":1,"x":0.8580246914705375,"t":"99"},{"y":0.95314993796778535,"h":0.03375352650564889,"w":0.30612678527832038,"c":1,"x":0.66991655033568553,"t":"IELTSXpress.com"}],"h":3395}